  text: 'A recipe card in Mae''s handwriting: ''Cherry. Earl''s mother''s.'' Somebody has written underneath, in pencil, very carefully: ''cherry cherry cherry cherry''. The pencil is the one from the pad by the telephone, where Mae writes her lists at three in the morning.'
  subject: Mae Whitlock
  customPrompt: Look at the recipe
  nerveShock: 0
  awareness: 0
